# Databricks Sales Data Engineering Project

## 1. Project Requirement

### Business requirement

The business receives customer order data in a CSV file. We need to:

1. Ingest the CSV file into Databricks.
2. Store the original data safely.
3. Perform data-quality checks.
4. Remove duplicate/invalid records.
5. Convert columns to correct data types.
6. Create clean Silver data.
7. Create business-ready Gold datasets.
8. Calculate sales by city and product.
9. Save all data as Delta tables.
10. Run SQL queries for reporting.
11. Eventually use the Gold data for dashboards/reporting.


### Overall workflow

```text
CSV Source
    ↓
Databricks Volume
    ↓
BRONZE
    ↓
Data Quality / Transformation
    ↓
SILVER
    ↓
Business Aggregation
    ↓
GOLD
    ↓
SQL / Reporting
```

