# 25. Step 19 — Gold: Sales by City

```python
from pyspark.sql.functions import sum, count

gold_city_sales = silver_df.groupBy("city").agg(
    sum("total_amount").alias("total_sales"),
    count("order_id").alias("total_orders")
)

display(gold_city_sales)
```

Output will look like:

```text
city          total_sales    total_orders
------------------------------------------
Bangalore     XXXXXXX        XX
Belgaum       XXXXXXX        XX
Bidar         XXXXXXX        XX
Chennai       XXXXXXX        XX
Delhi         XXXXXXX        XX
...
```

===================================================================================================

# 26. Step 20 — Save City Gold

```python
gold_city_sales.write \
    .format("delta") \
    .mode("overwrite") \
    .saveAsTable("sales_gold_by_city")
```

Now it is permanently saved as a Delta table.

